  "subject": "a woman who buys thirty bottles of soy sauce on a supermarket half-price day and then has nowhere in her tiny flat to put them, so they end up under the bed, in the shoe cabinet and lined along the bathtub",
  "caption": "Cantonese ska, 2-tone style with a Hong Kong street flavour. Offbeat skank guitar chops, walking bass, trombone and trumpet horn riffs answering each line, rimshot drums with snare-roll fills. Live-band recording, bright horns, dry room drums. Female alto, cheeky and punchy, clearly sung melody. Clear full voice, every word enunciated, steady sung melody on every line. 160 BPM, C major. Jaunty money comedy, skanking bounce. No reggaeton beat, no trap drums, no autotune, no rap, no synth pads.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n超市門口貼住大字\n豉油今日半價\n我諗住慳返一百蚊\n一嘢買咗三十支\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n收銀姐姐望住我\n問我係咪開餐廳\n\n[Chorus]\n三十支豉油 三十支豉油\n擺喺邊度好呢\n慳咗一百蚊好開心\n屋企冇位企\n\n[Verse]\n床底塞咗八支\n鞋櫃放埋六支\n浴缸邊排成一行\n沖涼好似去閱兵\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n男朋友上嚟食飯\n一開雪櫃又跌兩支\n\n[Chorus]\n三十支豉油 三十支豉油\n擺喺邊度好呢\n佢話不如開間餐廳\n招牌就叫豉油王\n\n[Verse]\n炒菜我落多兩羹\n煲湯我都加少少\n朋友生日送一支\n仲剩返二十一支\n\n[Bridge]\n超市又貼大字\n今日醋都半價\n我掩住眼行過去\n\n[Chorus]\n三十支豉油 三十支豉油\n食到過年未完\n慳咗一百蚊好開心\n下次唔好咁貪心\n\n[Chorus]\n三十支豉油 三十支豉油\n擺喺邊度好呢\n慳咗一百蚊好開心\n屋企冇位企\n\n[Outro]\n二十一支 二十支\n慢慢食 慢慢諗",
